<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <style>
        html {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
            box-sizing: inherit;
        }

        body * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        body {
            font: normal 100%/1.15;
            background-color: #7ed0f2;
            color: #fff
        }
        .wrapper {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 1298px;
            height: auto;
            margin: 2em auto 0 auto
        }
        .box {
            max-width: 70%;
            min-width: auto;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 1em 1em;
            text-align: center;
        }
        h1, p:not(:last-of-type) {
            text-shadow: 0 0 6px #216f79;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
            font-size: 8em;
        }
        p {
            margin-bottom: 0.5em;
            font-size: 3em;
        }

        p:first-of-type {
            margin-top: 4em;
        }

        @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .box {
                max-width: 90%;
                min-width: auto;
                margin: 0 auto;
                padding: 0em 0em;
                text-align: center;
        }
            h1 {
                margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
                font-size: 4em;
            }
            p {
                margin-bottom: 0.5em;
                font-size: 1em;
                font-weight: 600;
        }
        }

    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="box">
            <h1>ERROR</h1>
            <p> 시스템에 오류가 발생하였습니다
                <br>관리자에게 문의하세요.</p>
       </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>